# Build output. Binaries are release artefacts, published with a checksum
# manifest — never committed.
/dist/

# A real config contains a live station token. The example is committed; an
# actual config.toml at the repo root is a mistake worth blocking here rather
# than discovering in a commit.
config.toml
*.local.toml

# Local TLS material for testing against a throwaway gateway certificate.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.csr

# Never in this repository. It has no place in the contributor-facing tree at
# all, and internal/feeder/security_test.go fails if one appears.
.env
.env.*

# Editor and OS noise
*~
*.swp
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Go
*.test
*.out
